    "%@: heart rate rose +%@ bpm today vs +%@ across %lld earlier sessions — the same work costs less, a sign of better conditioning or a fresher day." : {
      "comment" : "A label that describes a workout set. The first argument is the string “%1$arg %2$arg kg × %3$arg”. The second argument is the weight lifted. The third argument is the number of repetitions. The fourth argument is the heart rate increase today. The fifth argument is the heart rate increase before. The sixth argument is the number of previous sessions.",
