    "Building your story" : {

    },
    "Built from your %lld sessions, and about %lld%% more accurate than assuming your usual. A guide for how hard to push, not a rule." : {
      "comment" : "A note that describes how accurate the forecast is, and that it's not a rule.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Built from your %1$lld sessions, and about %2$lld%% more accurate than assuming your usual. A guide for how hard to push, not a rule."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Built on team-sport research that scientists still debate. Women use slightly different constants (0.86 and 1.67). Lifting sessions logged without heart rate use an estimated intensity. Treat it as a ramp-rate gauge, not a prediction." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Oparte na badaniach sportów zespołowych, o których wciąż się dyskutuje. U kobiet stałe są nieco inne (0,86 i 1,67). Sesje siłowe bez tętna mają szacowaną intensywność. Traktuj to jako wskaźnik tempa wzrostu, a nie prognozę."
          }
        }
      }
    },
