        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Codziennie"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every finding shows how many days stand behind it, measured against your own normal." : {
      "comment" : "Text describing the evidence-based approach of Trace.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true
    },
    "Everyday movement has dropped — a common, mostly unconscious response to eating less. Extra steps win it back." : {
