    "Inputs (weekly means): resting HR↑, HRV↓, HR recovery↓,\n                       sleep↓, active minutes↓, breathing rate↑\nz = (this week − your weekly average) ÷ weekly SD\nSigned so positive = more wear than normal\nIndex = average z · needs 8+ weeks per input\nHigh-risk count = inputs in their worst quartile" : {
