    "Over the last %lld tracked nights you're running about %@h short of 8h/night. This tends to show up in recovery metrics within a few days." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Przez ostatnie %lld nocy brakuje Ci ok. %@ h do 8 h/noc. Zwykle widać to we wskaźnikach regeneracji w ciągu kilku dni."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Over the last 2 days, %@ %@ crept up together against your normal. This combination often shows up a day or two before you feel unwell — it's also what a hard training block can look like, so treat it as a nudge to rest if it develops, not a diagnosis." : {
      "comment" : "A list of symptoms that have been increasing over the last 2 days.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Over the last 2 days, %1$@ %2$@ crept up together against your normal. This combination often shows up a day or two before you feel unwell — it's also what a hard training block can look like, so treat it as a nudge to rest if it develops, not a diagnosis."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Przez ostatnie 2 dni %1$@ %2$@ wzrosły razem względem Twojej normy. Taka kombinacja często pojawia się dzień lub dwa przed złym samopoczuciem — ale tak samo może wyglądać ciężki blok treningowy, więc traktuj to jako sygnał do odpoczynku, jeśli się utrzyma, a nie jako diagnozę."
          }
        }
      }
    },
