    "Pairs from the last 120 days (same night & day):\n  deep sleep (min) ↔ HRV next morning\n  sleep ↔ resting HR · breathing rate ↔ HRV\n  sleep ↔ steps · sleep ↔ calories eaten\n  day strain → deep sleep the following night\nr = Pearson correlation, p from Fisher's z\nNeeds at least 14 pairs" : {
