    "Session load (TRIMP) = minutes × HRr × 0.64 × e^(1.92 × HRr)\nHRr = (avg HR − resting HR) ÷ (max HR − resting HR)\nAcute  = 7-day weighted average of daily load\nChronic = 28-day weighted average of daily load\nACWR = Acute ÷ Chronic" : {
