    "Trace" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Trace"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Trace focuses on food, training and your body. You can add a tracker later." : {

    },
    "Trace is an AI health analyst for strength athletes. It sits on top of your Apple Watch and connects your food, training, sleep and biometrics to explain what actually drives your recovery and performance, rather than adding another tracker." : {
      "comment" : "A description of the purpose of Trace.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true
    },
    "Trace isn't allowed to save weight to Apple Health. Turn it on in Settings → Health → Data Access & Devices → Trace." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Trace nie może zapisywać wagi w Zdrowiu. Włącz to w Ustawienia → Zdrowie → Dostęp do danych i urządzenia → Trace."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Trace reads heart rate and sleep from a watch or ring through Apple Health. Tell it what you have, and it only shows what your devices can measure." : {

    },
    "Trace reads Watch biomarkers and Yazio nutrition data (synced via Apple Health) to surface trends and plain-language insights. It only writes the workouts you log and the food you log to Health, and nothing leaves your device except the aggregated stats sent to the AI when you use it." : {
      "comment" : "A description of how Trace works.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true
    },
    "Trace reads Watch biomarkers and Yazio nutrition data (synced via Apple Health) to surface trends and plain-language insights. It only writes the workouts you log and the meals you scan to Health, and nothing leaves your device except the aggregated stats sent to the AI." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Trace odczytuje dane z Watch i dane żywieniowe z Yazio (przez Zdrowie), aby pokazać trendy i zrozumiałe wnioski. Do Zdrowia zapisuje tylko treningi i zeskanowane posiłki, a z urządzenia wychodzą jedynie zbiorcze statystyki wysyłane do AI."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Trace sits on top of your Apple Watch and explains what actually drives your recovery and performance, not just what your numbers were." : {
      "comment" : "Description of the onboarding screen that explains the purpose of Trace.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true
    },
    "Trace will close to switch language. Open it again and setup continues where you left off." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Trace zamknie się, aby zmienić język. Otwórz ją ponownie, a konfiguracja będzie kontynuowana."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Trace will close to switch language. Open it again from your Home Screen." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Trace zamknie się, aby zmienić język. Otwórz ją ponownie z ekranu głównego."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Trace works from the data your Watch, scale and food apps already put in Health." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Trace korzysta z danych, które zegarek, waga i aplikacje żywieniowe zapisują już w Zdrowiu."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Trace works out how much sleep you need each night and when to be in bed. It never sets an alarm on its own — you can optionally have a real one follow your wake time, later in Settings." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Trace oblicza, ile snu potrzebujesz każdej nocy i kiedy iść spać. Nigdy sam nie ustawia alarmu — możesz opcjonalnie sprawić, by prawdziwy alarm śledził Twoją porę pobudki, później w Ustawieniach."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Trace works out how much sleep you need each night and when to be in bed. No alarms, ever." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Trace wylicza, ile snu potrzebujesz każdej nocy i kiedy iść do łóżka. Nigdy żadnych alarmów."
          }
        }
      }
    },
