    "VO₂ max = Apple Watch estimate (outdoor walks, runs, hikes)\nCategory = your value against age/sex bands\n           (approx. Cooper Institute / ACSM norms)\nTypical  ≈ 47 − 0.4 × (age − 25)   men; 6 lower for women\nFitness age = age at which your value would be typical" : {
